OL,3,GNEWSAHuge waste facility fire shuts
OL,4,ATube and train lines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire has broken out at a waste
OL,7,Ffacility close to Wembley Stadium in
OL,8,Fnorth-west London, shutting Tube and
OL,9,Ftrain lines in the area.
OL,11,FThe London Fire Brigade (LFB) said 125
OL,12,Ffirefighters were tackling the blaze at
OL,13,Fan industrial estate on Hannah Close in
OL,14,FNeasden, with the smoke plumes visible
OL,15,Ffrom miles away in central London.
OL,17,FThe LFB was alerted just after 11:30
OL,18,FBST and has deployed 20 fire engines to
OL,19,Fthe scene. Residents have been warned
OL,20,Fto keep their windows and doors shut
OL,21,Fbecause of the huge amount of smoke.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
